1726 0 obj
  << /ActualText (All users must complete an ECE User Access Form and attend mandatory training sessions before using TNFC facilities\056 \n\nAll new and existing non\055ECE staff members and students will be required to additionally fill out an Attestation Form\056 Both forms are to be completed and sent to tnfc\100utoronto\056ca\056\015 Researchers will be charged for the use of the facilities on a per\055minute basis as logged by our LMACS Access System\054 and invoices will be distributed on a quarterly basis\056  \n\nFor non\055UofT academic and industrial researchers\054 please send an email to tnfc\100utoronto\056ca to work out an arrangement to come onsite for a short\055term visit\056)
     /K [ 31 ]
     /P 1727 0 R
     /Pg 1664 0 R
     /S /Span
